<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Simsmetal declares 21 cent final div.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Simsmetal declares 21 cent final div.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metals recycler Simsmetal Ltd said on Thursday it had declared a final dividend of 21 cents a share fully franked for the 1995/96 year ending June 30.</p>
<p>Simsmetal said its audited net profit in 1995/96 was in line with its previously announced unaudited net profit of A$46.7 million reported on August 15.</p>
</text>
